                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Radar Imaging Artifact Function that inheres in Artifacts that are designed to identify and produce visual representations of moving entities by using a radar to emit successive phase coherent pulses, which are sampled and added to the subsequent pulse to cancel out signals from non-moving entities such that only signals from moving entities remain and are displayed."@en ;
